1. A wall-mounted recessed product display structure comprising:

a housing configured to be mounted at least partially within a wall recess, the housing including a top panel, a bottom panel, and opposing side panels defining an interior display region having a front opening;

a plurality of modular display units removably positioned within the interior display region, each modular display unit being configured to support or present one or more products for viewing through the front opening;

wherein the plurality of modular display units includes at least one open-front module having an exposed product-access opening and at least one closed-front module having a front closure, panel, cover, door, or transparent member disposed across at least a portion of a front side of the closed-front module; and

wherein the modular display units are arranged within the housing in a selectable configuration to provide a recessed wall-mounted product display having both openly accessible display areas and enclosed display areas.

A display assembly comprising:

a display frame configured to define a recessed wall region, the display frame including a pair of horizontally extending frame panels and a pair of vertically extending frame panels;

wherein each of the horizontally extending frame panels has a length greater than a length of each of the vertically extending frame panels;

a plurality of vertically oriented modular display units positioned within the recessed wall region, each modular display unit extending substantially between the horizontally extending frame panels; and

one or more product display elements disposed within the recessed wall region and supported by, mounted to, or arranged in association with the plurality of vertically oriented modular display units.

In one embodiment, the display frame surrounds the recessed wall region to provide a framed product presentation area. The vertically oriented modular display units may be arranged adjacent to one another along a horizontal direction within the recessed wall region. The product display elements may include shelves, hooks, brackets, hangers, trays, panels, graphics, lighting elements, or other merchandising supports configured to display retail products.
